[[:db/add "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6" :answer/id #uuid "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6"] [:db/add "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad" :answer-field/id #uuid "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad"] [:db/add "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad" :answer-field/choices "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6"] [:db/add "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad" :answer-field/correct "767fa440-8fc1-5358-9025-7c8125e6aaa6"] [:db/ensure "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f" :question/id #uuid "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f"] [:db/add "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f" :question/problem "The slope of the tangent to the curve $y=\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}+6x}$ at the point where $x=3$ is{{field-1}}."] [:db/add "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f" :question/worked-solution "To find the slope at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nWe use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=2{x}^{2}+6x.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4x+6.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot (4x+6) \\\\  & =\\frac{2(2x+3)}{2\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}+6x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x+3}{\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}+6x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=3} & ={(\\frac{2x+3}{\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}+6x}})|}_{x=3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4(3)+6}{2\\sqrt{2(3{)}^{2}+6(3)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{18}{2\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f" :question/answer-fields "099a5827-9c3f-5cf3-bff5-003f736749ad"] [:db/ensure "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096842 :knowledge-point/questions "2cf444c8-3239-54ca-9516-8df227c41a5f"] [:db/add "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc" :answer/id #uuid "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc"] [:db/add "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc" :answer/value "\\frac{25}{12}"] [:db/ensure "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4"] [:db/add "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4" :answer-field/choices "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc"] [:db/add "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4" :answer-field/correct "7c11f32b-69c1-5fd0-bddb-c652f4dd99dc"] [:db/ensure "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1" :question/id #uuid "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1"] [:db/add "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1" :question/problem "The slope of the tangent to the curve $y=\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}-7x}$ at the point where $x=4$ is{{field-1}}."] [:db/add "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1" :question/worked-solution "To find the slope at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nWe use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=4{x}^{2}-7x.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=8x-7.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot (8x-7) \\\\  & =\\frac{8x-7}{2\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}-7x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8x-7}{2\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}-7x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=4,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=4} & ={(\\frac{8x-7}{2\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}-7x}})|}_{x=4} \\\\  & =\\frac{8(4)-7}{2\\sqrt{4(4{)}^{2}-7(4)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{25}{2\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =\\frac{25}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1" :question/answer-fields "c3399efe-ec83-56d2-bfb3-9ba448fc95b4"] [:db/ensure "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096842 :knowledge-point/questions "309f479d-646b-5563-8225-cb5faadfd4a1"] [:db/add "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8" :answer/id #uuid "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8"] [:db/add "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8" :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}"] [:db/ensure "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4"] [:db/add "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" :answer-field/choices "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8"] [:db/add "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" :answer-field/correct "e15b33e8-c7f6-5a5e-93f2-cb68037c61a8"] [:db/ensure "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e" :question/id #uuid "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e"] [:db/add "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e" :question/problem "The slope of the tangent to the curve $y=\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}$ at the point where $x=1$ is{{field-1}}."] [:db/add "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e" :question/worked-solution "To find the slope at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nWe use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=-5{x}^{2}+9x.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=9-10x.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot (9-10x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{10x-9}{2\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{10x-9}{2\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={(-\\frac{10x-9}{2\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}})|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-10(1)}{2\\sqrt{-5(1{)}^{2}+9(1)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1}{2\\sqrt{4}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e" :question/answer-fields "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4"] [:db/ensure "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096842 :knowledge-point/questions "86491180-1d5e-5901-bd2b-dafda235930e"] [:db/add "e031eaae-76f9-58af-b3e6-50abf25c826b" :answer/id #uuid "e031eaae-76f9-58af-b3e6-50abf25c826b"] [:db/add "e031eaae-76f9-58af-b3e6-50abf25c826b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e031eaae-76f9-58af-b3e6-50abf25c826b"